       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWM4805BM.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * RECONCILIAÇÃO AUTOMÁTICA DE OPERAÇÕES  (Nivel 5)               *
      *                                                                *
      * Reconciliação Automática de Operações com relações de 1/n:     *
      * OPI/OPM e Acquiring                                            *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWM4805BM'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD9701 END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY SXCL0002.
           COPY SXCL0445.
           COPY ETCL1000.
           COPY ETCK0002.
      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT9701             PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT9701'.
           05 CON-SWPARAM              PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
           05 CON-PEND                 PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-RECONC               PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
           05 CON-RECONC-PROP          PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RP'.
           05 CON-AUTOMATICA           PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-MANUAL               PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
           05 CON-MT940                PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT940'.
           05 CON-MT950                PIC  X(05) VALUE 'MT950'.
           05 CON-O00                  PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.
           05 CON-SPACES               PIC  X(01) VALUE ' '.
           05 CON-NAO                  PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           05 CON-CREDITO              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'C'.
           05 CON-IRECONC-SIM          PIC  X(01) VALUE 'S'.
           05 CON-IRECONC-NAO          PIC  X(01) VALUE 'N'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-VARIAVEIS.
          05 WS-DATA                      PIC 9(08) VALUE ZEROES.
          05 WS-DATA-R REDEFINES WS-DATA.
             10 WS-NANO                   PIC 9(04).
             10 WS-NMES                   PIC 9(02).
             10 WS-NDIA                   PIC 9(02).
          05 WS-PRVALBOL                  PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACE.
          05 WS-I                         PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE ZEROES.
      *
          05 WS-CREF                      PIC  X(16) VALUE SPACES.
          05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CREF.
             10 FILLER                    PIC  X(07).
                88 SW-ACQUIRER                 VALUE 'CAP OF '.
             10 WS-DATA-ACQ               PIC  X(08).
             10 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DATA-ACQ.
                15 WS-DT-AQ-ANO           PIC  9(02).
                15 FILLER                 PIC  X(01).
                15 WS-DT-AQ-MES           PIC  9(02).
                15 FILLER                 PIC  X(01).
                15 WS-DT-AQ-DIA           PIC  9(02).
             10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
          05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CREF.
             10 FILLER                    PIC  X(03).
                88 SW-OPIOPM                   VALUE 'OPI' 'OPM'.
                88 SW-CQA                      VALUE 'CQA'.
                88 SW-RDXCDX                   VALUE 'RDE' 'RDI'
                                                     'CDE' 'CDI'.
             10 FILLER                    PIC  X(13).
      *
          05 WS-CCHAVE                    PIC  X(30) VALUE SPACES.
          05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-CCHAVE.
             10 WS-KEY-ANO                PIC  9(02).
             10 WS-KEY-MES                PIC  9(02).
             10 WS-KEY-DIA                PIC  9(02).
             10 FILLER                    PIC  X(24).
      *
          05 WS-MRVLR-EXTR            PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                       VALUE ZEROS.
          05 WS-MRVLR-MOVIM           PIC S9(13)V9(02) COMP-3
                                                       VALUE ZEROS.
      *
          05 WS-COUNT                 PIC S9(10) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
          05 WS-CCODEST               PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  SW-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-CURSOR-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-OK                         VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-END                        VALUE -1.
           05 SW-RECONC-STATE              PIC S9(03) COMP-3
                                                      VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO                  VALUE ZEROES.
              88 SW-RECONC-OPER                      VALUE -1.
      *
           05 SW-PRVALBOL-STATUS           PIC  X(01)      VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-OK                            VALUE 'S'.
              88 SW-PRVALBOL-NOTOK                         VALUE 'N'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
      *
           COPY VIAK0001.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY SWCL4805.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ETCL0002-COMMAREA
                                SWCL4805-COMMAREA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           MOVE '0000-MAINLINE    '        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           MOVE SPACES                     TO ETCL0002-DEBUG.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                 THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE SW-SWITCHES.
      *
           SET ETCL0002-RCODE-OK       TO TRUE.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO WS-CCODEST
           MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-COUNT
                                          SW-RECONC-STATE.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE
                 THRU 1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1100-VALIDAR-LINKAGE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO          TO TRUE.

           IF SW-RECONC-OPER
              MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CREF        TO WS-CREF
              PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM +1 BY +1
                UNTIL WS-I GREATER THAN +4
                   OR SW-ACQUIRER
                   OR SW-OPIOPM
                   OR SW-CQA
                   OR SW-RDXCDX
                   OR NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
                   OR NOT SW-RECONC-OPER
      *
                 EVALUATE TRUE
                    WHEN WS-I EQUAL +1
                       MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CREFOPR  TO WS-CREF
                    WHEN WS-I EQUAL +2
                       MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CREFEXT  TO WS-CREF
                    WHEN WS-I EQUAL +3
                       SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO TO TRUE
                 END-EVALUATE
              END-PERFORM
           END-IF
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN NOT ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              WHEN NOT SW-RECONC-OPER
                   CONTINUE
              WHEN SW-ACQUIRER
                   PERFORM 2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER
                      THRU 2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER-EXIT
              WHEN SW-OPIOPM
                   PERFORM 2400-RECONC-OPIOPM
                      THRU 2400-RECONC-OPIOPM-EXIT
              WHEN SW-CQA
              WHEN SW-RDXCDX
                   PERFORM 2500-RECONC-CQA
                      THRU 2500-RECONC-CQA-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER                                          **
      ******************************************************************
       2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER.
      *
           MOVE '2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-BALC           TO SWCD9701-MRBALC.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CCB            TO SWCD9701-MRCCB.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CMOED          TO SWCD9701-MRMOED

      * operacoes de Acquirer VISA ou Mastercard
           MOVE 'VSM5550'                  TO SWCD9701-MRETRB.
      *
           MOVE SPACES                     TO WS-CCHAVE.
           MOVE WS-DT-AQ-ANO               TO WS-KEY-ANO.
           MOVE WS-DT-AQ-MES               TO WS-KEY-MES.
           MOVE WS-DT-AQ-DIA               TO WS-KEY-DIA.
           MOVE WS-CCHAVE                  TO SWCD9701-CCHAVE
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-MVALOR         TO WS-MRVLR-EXTR.
           IF SWCL4805-IN-CDBCR EQUAL CON-CREDITO
              COMPUTE WS-MRVLR-EXTR = WS-MRVLR-EXTR * -1
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL( SUM( MRVLR ), 0 )
                INTO :WS-MRVLR-MOVIM
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRBALC   =  :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB    =  :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                 AND MRMOED   =  :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND CCHAVE   =  :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                 AND MRETRB   =  :SWCD9701-MRETRB
                 AND IDRECONC =  0
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2900-UPD-MOVIM
                      THRU 2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2300-RECONC-ACQUIRER-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2400-RECONC-OPIOPM                                            **
      ******************************************************************
       2400-RECONC-OPIOPM.
      *
           MOVE '2400-RECONC-OPIOPM'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-BALC           TO SWCD9701-MRBALC.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CCB            TO SWCD9701-MRCCB.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CMOED          TO SWCD9701-MRMOED
           MOVE WS-CREF                    TO SWCD9701-CCHAVE
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-MVALOR         TO WS-MRVLR-EXTR
           IF SWCL4805-IN-CDBCR EQUAL CON-CREDITO
              COMPUTE WS-MRVLR-EXTR = WS-MRVLR-EXTR * -1
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT MRNOPR
                   , MRNORD
                INTO :SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD9701-MRNORD
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRBALC   =  :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB    =  :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                 AND MRMOED   =  :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND CCHAVE   =  :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                 AND IDRECONC =  0
               FETCH FIRST ROW ONLY
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   MOVE ZEROES              TO SWCD9701-MRNORD
                                               SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2410-APURAR-VALOR
                      THRU 2410-APURAR-VALOR-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2400-RECONC-OPIOPM'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2400-RECONC-OPIOPM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2410-APURAR-VALOR                                             **
      ******************************************************************
       2410-APURAR-VALOR.
      *
           MOVE '2410-APURAR-VALOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL( SUM( MRVLR ), 0 )
                INTO :WS-MRVLR-MOVIM
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRBALC   =  :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB    =  :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                 AND MRMOED   =  :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND MRNOPR   =  :SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                 AND IDRECONC =  0
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
      *       WHEN WS-MRVLR-MOVIM NOT EQUAL WS-MRVLR-EXTR
      *            SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2900-UPD-MOVIM
                      THRU 2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2410-APURAR-VALOR'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2410-APURAR-VALOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2500-RECONC-CQA                                               **
      ******************************************************************
       2500-RECONC-CQA.
      *
           MOVE '2500-RECONC-CQA'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-BALC           TO SWCD9701-MRBALC.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CCB            TO SWCD9701-MRCCB.
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-CMOED          TO SWCD9701-MRMOED

           MOVE WS-CREF                    TO SWCD9701-CCHAVE
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-MVALOR         TO WS-MRVLR-EXTR.
           IF SWCL4805-IN-CDBCR EQUAL CON-CREDITO
              COMPUTE WS-MRVLR-EXTR = WS-MRVLR-EXTR * -1
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL( SUM( MRVLR ), 0 )
                INTO :WS-MRVLR-MOVIM
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRBALC   =  :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB    =  :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                 AND MRMOED   =  :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND CCHAVE   =  :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                 AND IDRECONC =  0
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
      *       WHEN WS-MRVLR-MOVIM  NOT EQUAL WS-MRVLR-EXTR
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2900-UPD-MOVIM
                      THRU 2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2500-RECONC-CQA'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2500-RECONC-CQA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2510-APURAR-VALOR                                             **
      ******************************************************************
       2510-APURAR-VALOR.
      *
           MOVE '2510-APURAR-VALOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT IFNULL( SUM( MRVLR ), 0 )
                INTO :WS-MRVLR-MOVIM
                FROM SWVT9701
               WHERE MRBALC   =  :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                 AND MRCCB    =  :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                 AND MRMOED   =  :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                 AND CCHAVE   =  :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                 AND IDRECONC =  0
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
      *       WHEN WS-MRVLR-MOVIM  NOT EQUAL WS-MRVLR-EXTR
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2900-UPD-MOVIM
                      THRU 2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2510-APURAR-VALOR'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2510-APURAR-VALOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2900-UPD-MOVIM                                                 *
      ******************************************************************
       2900-UPD-MOVIM.
      *
           MOVE '2900-UPD-MOVIM          ' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN SW-ACQUIRER
              WHEN SW-CQA
              WHEN SW-RDXCDX
      *
                   EXEC SQL
                      SELECT IFNULL(COUNT(*), 0)
                        INTO :WS-COUNT
                        FROM SWVT9701
                       WHERE MRBALC  = :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                         AND MRCCB   = :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                         AND MRMOED  = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                         AND CCHAVE  = :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                         AND IDRECONC = 0
                        WITH UR
                   END-EXEC
      *
              WHEN SW-OPIOPM
      *
                   EXEC SQL
                      SELECT IFNULL(COUNT(*), 0)
                        INTO :WS-COUNT
                        FROM SWVT9701
                       WHERE MRBALC  = :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                         AND MRCCB   = :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                         AND MRMOED  = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                         AND MRNOPR  = :SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                         AND IDRECONC = 0
                        WITH UR
                   END-EXEC
      *
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
                   IF WS-COUNT        GREATER ZEROS
                      PERFORM 2910-REGISTA-SWT97
                         THRU 2910-REGISTA-SWT97-EXIT
                   ELSE
                      SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO TO TRUE
                   END-IF
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2900-UPD-MOVIM'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2900-UPD-MOVIM-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * 2910-REGISTA-SWT97                                             *
      ******************************************************************
       2910-REGISTA-SWT97.
      *
           MOVE '2910-REGISTA-SWT97     '   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                 TO SWCD9701-CUSERID.
      *
           MOVE SWCL4805-IN-IDRECONC       TO SWCD9701-IDRECONC

           EVALUATE WS-COUNT
               WHEN 1
                    MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-1-PARA-1
                      TO SWCD9701-CNATREC
               WHEN OTHER
                    MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-N-PARA-1
                      TO SWCD9701-CNATREC
           END-EVALUATE

           IF WS-MRVLR-MOVIM  EQUAL WS-MRVLR-EXTR
              MOVE SWCK0002-RECONCILIADO   TO SWCD9701-CCODEST
                                              WS-CCODEST
              MOVE SWCK0002-SIM            TO SWCD9701-IRECONC
              MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-AUTOMATICA
                                           TO SWCD9701-CTIPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-SUGERIDA
                                           TO SWCD9701-CCODEST
                                              WS-CCODEST
              MOVE SWCK0002-NAO            TO SWCD9701-IRECONC
              MOVE SWCK0002-RECONC-MANUAL  TO SWCD9701-CTIPREC
           END-IF
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN SW-ACQUIRER
              WHEN SW-CQA
              WHEN SW-RDXCDX
      *
                   EXEC SQL
                      UPDATE SWVT9701
                         SET IDRECONC = :SWCD9701-IDRECONC
                           , CCODEST  = :SWCD9701-CCODEST
                           , CNATREC  = :SWCD9701-CNATREC
                           , IRECONC = :SWCD9701-IRECONC
                           , CTIPREC = :SWCD9701-CTIPREC
                           , CUSERID = :SWCD9701-CUSERID
                           , HTIMEST = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
                       WHERE MRBALC  = :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                         AND MRCCB   = :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                         AND MRMOED  = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                         AND CCHAVE  = :SWCD9701-CCHAVE
                         AND IDRECONC = 0
                   END-EXEC
      *
              WHEN SW-OPIOPM
      *
                   EXEC SQL
                      UPDATE SWVT9701
                         SET IDRECONC = :SWCD9701-IDRECONC
                           , CCODEST  = :SWCD9701-CCODEST
                           , CNATREC  = :SWCD9701-CNATREC
                           , IRECONC = :SWCD9701-IRECONC
                           , CTIPREC = :SWCD9701-CTIPREC
                           , CUSERID = :SWCD9701-CUSERID
                           , HTIMEST = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
                       WHERE MRBALC  = :SWCD9701-MRBALC
                         AND MRCCB   = :SWCD9701-MRCCB
                         AND MRMOED  = :SWCD9701-MRMOED
                         AND MRNOPR  = :SWCD9701-MRNOPR
                         AND IDRECONC = 0
                   END-EXEC
      *
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9020-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-OK
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER       TO TRUE
              WHEN ETCL0002-SQL-NOTFND
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                   SET SW-RECONC-OPER-NAO   TO TRUE
                   SET ETCL0002-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                   MOVE '2910-REGISTA-SWT97'
                     TO ETCL0002-GINFO-ERRO
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       2910-REGISTA-SWT97-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF ETCL0002-SEM-ERROS
              MOVE SW-RECONC-STATE         TO SWCL4805-OUT-RECONC-STATE
              MOVE WS-COUNT                TO SWCL4805-OUT-COUNT-MOVIM
              MOVE WS-CCODEST              TO SWCL4805-OUT-CCODEST
           END-IF.
      *
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
           COPY ETCP0010.
           COPY VIAP0015.
